        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148361,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bazen bir dizi değerleri serisini tek bir değere dönüştürmemiz gerekir. Örneğin, nihai puanı hesaplamak istediğimizde.</p><p>Bunu yapmanın klasik bir yolu döngü kullanmaktır.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"82\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" score += element;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>score</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148362,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ancak JavaScript daha basit ve zaten mevcut olan bir metot sunar. <code>.reduce()</code>, satır içi bir fonksiyon kullanarak dizi değerlerini tek bir değerde birleştirebilir.</p><p><code>.reduce()</code> şu söz dizimini kullanır: <code>ArrayName.reduce()</code>. Şimdi bunu <code>points</code> dizisi üzerinde nasıl çağırabileceğimize bakalım.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"list\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = points.reduce();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>points</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve sonra <code>reduce</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148363,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değerlerin nasıl birleştirileceğini <code>.reduce()</code> fonksiyonuna anlatmak için önce bir fonksiyonu parametre olarak geçirmemiz gerekir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = points.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>function</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148364,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonumuzun iki parametreye ihtiyacı var: ilki önceki <strong>indirgeme</strong> işleminin sonucuna, ikincisi ise mevcut değere erişmek için.</p><p>Şu iki parametreyi, bu sırayla ekle: <code>prev</code> ve <code>curr</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"76\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = points.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>prev,</code>, ardından <code>curr</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148365,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>reduce()</code>, bir dizi üzerinde yineleme yapar ve her değerde, tek bir değere ulaşana kadar iki parametreyle bir işlem gerçekleştirir.</p><p>Örneğin, bir puan toplamını hesaplamak için satır içi fonksiyon, <code>prev</code> indirgeme sonucuyla <code>curr</code> değerinin toplamını döndürür.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = points.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prev + curr;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>prev + curr</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148366,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sözdizimimizi basitleştirmek için satır içi fonksiyon yerine bir JavaScript ok fonksiyonu kullanabiliriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"96\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = points.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>(prevVal, currVal)</code>, ardından <code>=&gt;</code> ve son olarak <code>prevVal + currVal</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148367,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyona üçüncü bir parametre eklersen her yinelemenin indeksine de erişebilirsin.</p><p>Bu örnekte, <code>damage</code> değerlerini toplamak için <code>.reduce()</code> kullanıyoruz; ayrıca ikinci diziden bir kombo çarpanı uygulamak için <code>index</code> değerini de dahil ediyoruz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"160\" endIndex=\"165\" /><option startIndex=\"214\" endIndex=\"219\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage = [\" /><text value=\"17.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24.75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" comboMultiplier = [\" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalDamage = damage.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + (currVal * comboMultiplier[index]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalDamage);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>index</code>, ardından <code>index</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
