            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyona üçüncü, isteğe bağlı bir parametre ekleyerek neye erişebiliriz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İndeks</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Çağrıyı yapan dizi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İndeks öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148373,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>damage</code> dizisinde <code>.reduce()</code> fonksiyonunu çağır.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"81\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage = [\" /><text value=\"17.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24.75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalDamage = damage.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalDamage);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>damage</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>reduce</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148374,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.reduce()</code> fonksiyonunun içine satır içi bir fonksiyon ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" drops = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalLoot = drops.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>function</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148375,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Satır içi fonksiyonun önceki indirgeme değerine ve geçerli dizi değerine erişmesini sağlamak için uygun parametreleri ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"72\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" drops = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalLoot = drops.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prev * curr;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalLoot);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>prev</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 148376,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.reduce()</code> fonksiyonunun tüm <code>parts</code> öğelerini bir seviye adında birleştirmesini istiyoruz.</p><p>Satır içi fonksiyonda, önceki indirgeme değerini geçerli parçayla birleştirerek döndürmesini sağlayacak doğru anahtar kelimeyi yaz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"107\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parts = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Room&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = parts.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prev + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + curr;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelName);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 148377,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ok fonksiyonunu, <code>totalDamage</code> değişkeni <code>damage</code> dizisi değerlerinin toplamını saklayacak şekilde tamamla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"121\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage = [\" /><text value=\"17.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24.75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalDamage = damage.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalDamage);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>+ currVal</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          }
